Source-code LICENSE for revOS

This project consists of harness scaffolding and individual evidence records.
The harness scaffolding is the original work of cosmic-hydra and is licensed
under the MIT terms above.

Each evidence record in `subsystems/<area>/evidence/*.json` may reference third
party source material via the `cross_reference` array. Such references are
intentionally limited to opensource-apple mirrors, swift-corelibs-* mirrors,
and public homepages; consult each referenced project's own license before
redistributing. See:

  - https://github.com/apple-oss-distributions
  - https://github.com/apple/swift-corelibs-foundation
  - https://github.com/apple/swift-corelibs-dispatch
  - https://github.com/apple/swift-corelibs-xctest

Nothing in this repository grants any rights to Apple Inc. trademarks,
closed-source binaries, or private frameworks. The reverse-engineering work
in this repository targets only public, exported symbols.
